OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1786128494
OL,3,CStage once trod by Shakespeare
OL,4,Cinspires new football club shirt design
OL,6,FFrom The Specials' record label to a
OL,7,Fsurrealist painter - the arts have a
OL,8,Flong association with the design of
OL,9,Ffootball kits.
OL,11,FNow we can add Shakespeare to the
OL,12,Flist, as a stage once believed to have
OL,13,Fwitnessed a performance from the Bard
OL,14,Fhimself has inspired the design of a
OL,15,Fnew shirt.
OL,17,FNon-league King's Lynn Town has teamed
OL,18,Fup with the town's St George's
OL,19,FGuildhall, the UK's oldest working
OL,20,Ftheatre, to design its new away shirt.
