PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1786128494
OL,3,CStage once trod by Shakespeare
OL,4,Cinspires new football club shirt design
OL,6,FThe kit takes its inspiration from the
OL,7,Fancient timber floor of the guildhall
OL,8,Fwhere William Shakespeare is believed
OL,9,Fto have performed more than 430 years
OL,10,Fago.
OL,12,FThe shirt's stripes are designed to
OL,13,Fresemble the building's floorboards
OL,14,Funcovered during the Guildhall's
OL,15,Frestoration.
OL,17,FIt is not the first time clubs have
OL,18,Fembraced their local heritage in their
OL,19,Fshirt design.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
