OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1786128494
OL,3,CStage once trod by Shakespeare
OL,4,Cinspires new football club shirt design
OL,6,FCoventry City based a third kit on the
OL,7,Frecord label 2 Tone - the record
OL,8,Fcompany which originated in the city
OL,9,Fand produced bands like The Specials,
OL,10,FThe Selecter, plus Madness, The Beat,
OL,11,Fand Bad Manners.
OL,13,FMore recently the national team of
OL,14,FBelgium sported a kit based on the
OL,15,Fworks of surrealist painter Rene
OL,16,FMagritte.
OL,26,@wD@`rr
