OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1786128494
OL,3,CStage once trod by Shakespeare
OL,4,Cinspires new football club shirt design
OL,6,FThe shirt was a collaboration between
OL,7,FAdidas and the Royal Belgian Football
OL,8,FAssociation. The print is a playful
OL,9,Fnod to Magritte's work with a
OL,10,Freference to the artist's The
OL,11,FTreachery of Images 'Ceci n'est pas
OL,12,Fune pipe' (This is not a pipe) visible
OL,13,Fas subtle detail in the neck of
OL,14,Fjersey: "Ceci n'est pas un maillot"
OL,15,F(This is not a jersey).
OL,26,@vD@IOUvD@cO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
