FL,310,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1786128494
OL,3,CStage once trod by Shakespeare
OL,4,Cinspires new football club shirt design
OL,6,FTim FitzHigham, Creative Director of
OL,7,FSt George's Guildhall, said the
OL,8,Fcollaboration brought together King's
OL,9,FLynn's sporting and theatrical
OL,10,Fheritage in a way few towns could
OL,11,Fmatch.
OL,13,F"It's a wonderful idea," he said. "As
OL,14,Fsomeone born and brought up in King's
OL,15,FLynn, a huge admirer of the Linnets
OL,16,Fand someone who has spent years
OL,17,Fhelping uncover the Guildhall's
OL,18,Fremarkable history, seeing those
OL,19,Fancient floorboards inspire the club's
OL,20,Faway shirt is incredibly special.
OL,26,@uD@AOUuD@XO]uD@cOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,310,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1786128494
OL,3,CStage once trod by Shakespeare
OL,4,Cinspires new football club shirt design
OL,6,F"I was fortunate enough to help
OL,7,Funcover that historic floor during the
OL,8,Frestoration, so to see it now
OL,9,Ftravelling the country on the shirts
OL,10,Fof King's Lynn Town feels entirely
OL,11,Ffitting.
OL,13,F"People often think football began in
OL,14,Fthe Victorian era, but Shakespeare
OL,15,Factually mentions the game twice in
OL,16,Fhis plays. In The Comedy of Errors he
OL,17,Fwrites of someone being 'spurned like
OL,18,Fa football', while in King Lear he
OL,19,Frefers to a 'base football player'.
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,310,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1786128494
OL,3,CStage once trod by Shakespeare
OL,4,Cinspires new football club shirt design
OL,6,F"Football and Shakespeare have been
OL,7,Frubbing shoulders for far longer than
OL,8,Fmost people realise.
OL,10,F"Shakespeare was undoubtedly the
OL,11,Fgreatest player ever to perform on the
OL,12,FGuildhall floor. Now King's Lynn's
OL,13,Fplayers will wear that same floor on
OL,14,Ftheir shirts wherever they go."
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@AOU
